*   **hp**: The Shuttle S is available with the 90PS (89 hp) or 110PS (108 hp) 2.0 TDI engines. The 84PS (83 hp) engine was also available on the T30 S in earlier T6 models. These are low power outputs compared to the market average (~200 hp). Score: `-0.70`.
*   **torque**: The 90PS engine has 220Nm (162 lb-ft) and the 110PS has 250Nm (184 lb-ft). The 84PS engine had 220Nm (162 lb-ft). These are below the average benchmark (~190 lb-ft), especially the lower power options. Score: `-0.20`.
